The <ansi fg="command">dexterity</ansi> stat measures your physical speed,
agility, and coordination.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Higher Dexterity allows you to act more quickly in combat,
land attacks more reliably, and dodge incoming blows. It
also affects your ability to flee from dangerous situations
and influences unarmed combat effectiveness.

Dexterity improves through use -- the more you rely on
speed and agility in your adventures, the more it grows.

